cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or dataset, please cite it as below, and cite LA-P1 (the source of the prompt and rubric)."
title: "Model, Not Mode: a pre-registered model x mode grid (harness and dataset)"
abstract: >-
  Code is MIT; data, prompts and documentation are CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSE-DATA).
  A pre-registered model x mode grid. Six LLM families are each run in a fast and a
  reasoning mode on one frozen, constrained systems-design prompt, five replicates per
  cell. Answers are scored blind with a nine-dimension rubric and the variance in each
  dimension is decomposed into model, mode, interaction and residual shares.
